OL,3,GNEWSAGroup inspiring adults with
OL,4,Alearning difficulties celebrates award
OL,5,Anomination
OL,6,
OL,7,FA group that has been inspiring adults
OL,8,Fwith learning disabilities for more
OL,9,Fthan 30 years, has been nominated for
OL,10,FBBC Make a Difference Award.
OL,12,FThe Bridge Association in County Antrim
OL,13,Fis a finalist in the Community Group
OL,14,FAward category for Northern Ireland.
OL,15,FThose behind the centre say they've no
OL,16,Fidea who put them forward.
OL,18,FThomas Murray has been a trainee The
OL,19,FBridge Association for more than 15
OL,20,Fyears.
OL,23,APub: 30-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
